1
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:04,020
快来 麦克斯 课程要开始啦
Come on, Max! Class is starting.

2
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:06,120
我给你预留了我旁边的位置
I saved you a spot next to me.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,580
马上来 等我先把巨乳绑好
Be right there. Strapping in the girls.

4
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:10,844
左咪今天有点暴躁
Lefty's a little cranky this morning.

5
00:00:10,844 --> 00:00:14,000
感谢你把这些健身带
Thanks for getting these work out bands

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,460
从健身房的垃圾堆里捡回来
out of the Equinox dumpster.

7
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:17,280
我当时人都在里面了嘛
I was already in there.

8
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,700
我跟我的会计约在那里见面
I had a meeting with my accountant.

9
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,320
对了 我们生意不太好啊
We're not doing great, by the way.

10
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:25,480
我们可以用这些健身带做阻力训练
We're gonna do resistance work with them.

11
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,280
我已经够有阻力了
I'm already resistant.

12
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:28,740
我简直都要是暴力了好吗
I'm almost at violent.

13
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,260
跟我做
Do what I'm doing.

14
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:33,700
露出股沟吗
Let my crack stick out?

15
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:38,440
屁股动起来 摆动 再摆动
And pulse, and pulse, and pulse.

16
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:40,080
我来帮你把脉搏[摆动]停下吧
Let me just get rid of that pulse for you.

17
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:43,840
别闹了 麦克斯上次药店的机器说
Come on, Max, the heart machine at Rite Aid said you were 80

18
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:45,960
你的心脏等同80岁老人 还让你去买轮椅
and printed you a prescription for a wheelchair.

19
00:00:47,160 --> 00:00:48,740
数到三开始
On the count of three.

20
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:53,940
一 二 三
One, two, three.

21
00:00:58,740 --> 00:01:00,740
有床压在我身上吗
Is there a bed on me?

22
00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:02,960
把我的轮椅推来
Get my wheelchair.

23
00:01:14,620 --> 00:01:16,580
姑娘们
Hey, girls.

24
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:19,440
快看芭芭拉的新车
Check out Barbara's new ride.

25
00:01:24,690 --> 00:01:26,100
我们需要帮助
We need help.

26
00:01:26,100 --> 00:01:30,380
而且不单是因为芭芭拉比我先拥有豪华SUV
And not just because Barbara has a luxury SUV before I do.

27
00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:36,760
很棒的健身
Great workout.

28
00:01:37,180 --> 00:01:38,920
我要吃个贝果放松一下
I'm gonna cool down with a bagel.

29
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:42,560
我下楼只是为了给你送信
No, I just came down here to bring you your mail.

30
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:45,000
而芭芭拉想来炫耀她的新车
And Barbara wanted to show off her car

31
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,600
给你们俩穷光蛋看
because you girls are poor.

32
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:49,860
迟交的手机账单 电费...
Overdue cell phone bill, electricity--

33
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:52,100
苏菲 这些信都是上个月的了
Sophie, this mail is from a month ago.

34
00:01:52,720 --> 00:01:55,680
怎么 信又不怕放 又不像茅屋起司
What? It's mail, not cottage cheese.

35
00:01:56,420 --> 00:01:59,698
等等 里面好像是有一点茅屋起司
Oh, wait. I think there might be a little cottage cheese in there.

36
00:01:59,698 --> 00:02:02,824
还有起司能让我沾着贝果吃吗
Got any of that for my bagel?

37
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,600
天啊
Oh, my God.

38
00:02:04,820 --> 00:02:07,380
我的人生大电影要上映了
The movie they're making about my life is coming out.

39
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:09,180
名字是叫"天赐无聊"吗
Is it called Good Will Boring?

40
00:02:10,480 --> 00:02:12,920
麦克斯 我们被邀请去参加媒体餐会
And Max, we're invited to the press junket

41
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:14,020
来宣传电影
to promote the movie.

42
00:02:14,020 --> 00:02:15,700
两天后
In two days?

43
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:21,260
我觉得连我的那位发型师都来不及救你
I don't even think my hair girl could help you in time

44
00:02:21,260 --> 00:02:23,020
而且她有三只手呢
and she's got three hands.

45
00:02:24,260 --> 00:02:26,800
苏菲 希望我们还来得及表示出席
Sophie, I hope it's not too late to RSVP.

46
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:29,040
我一直在等有关这部电影的消息
I was waiting for some news about the movie.

47
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:30,960
差点以为所托非人呢
I thought it went to the wrong person.

48
00:02:30,980 --> 00:02:32,120
就像我20多岁的人生
Like my 20s.

49
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:37,080
走吧 芭芭拉 咱们去游乐场绕街
Come on, Barbara. Let's cruise the playground

50
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:39,300
嘲笑开电动车的其他宝宝
and make fun of babies in Chevy Volts.

51
00:02:41,620 --> 00:02:43,880
芭芭拉能顺路放我在健身房下车吗
Uh, can Barbara drop me off at Equinox?

52
00:02:44,060 --> 00:02:46,260
他们会在3点30丢掉过期的能量棒
They throw out the expired Clif Bars at 3:30.

53
00:02:50,700 --> 00:02:53,620
阿憨 麦克斯跟我得出席我电影的记者会
Oh, Han, Max and I have to do press for my movie,

54
00:02:53,620 --> 00:02:54,740
所以明天没法上班
so we can't work tomorrow.

55
00:02:55,180 --> 00:02:57,780
能理解 哪能打破您6年的旷工记录呢
I get it. Why break your six-year streak?

56
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:00,800
等你拿到了你电影的钱
I guess with all your movie money,

57
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:03,280
你们能幸福高飞 我也能请两位新的
you two can move on and I can hire two waitresses

58
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:05,300
不会把我办公室当赌场的服务员
who don't use my office as a gambling hall.

59
00:03:07,100 --> 00:03:08,540
阿憨 卡洛琳已经把从电影赚来的钱
Han, Caroline already spent all the movie money

60
00:03:08,540 --> 00:03:09,440
全投进甜品酒吧了
on the dessert bar.

61
00:03:09,620 --> 00:03:11,160
另外 20分钟后我要用你的办公室
Also, I need your office in 20 minutes.

62
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:12,580
我们要面试新的轮盘赌荷官
We're interviewing a new roulette dealer.

63
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:15,240
那你能好歹告诉他们
Well, can you at least tell people

64
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:17,480
别用我的家庭相片熄烟吗
not to put cigarettes out on my family photos?

65
00:03:18,620 --> 00:03:20,560
我奶奶都被烧一个大洞了
There's a giant hole in my grandma.

66
00:03:22,980 --> 00:03:24,560
他们把演员名单发来了
Ooh! They just sent a cast list.

67
00:03:24,940 --> 00:03:26,640
猜猜是谁扮演我
Guess who's playing me?

68
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:28,920
苔丝·沃克
Tess Walker.

69
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:32,560
她是个很大...
She is a very big--

70
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:34,200
等等 我读一下她大在哪里
hold on, let me read what she's a very big.

71
00:03:34,740 --> 00:03:37,520
如果是胸部 那他们真是完全没调查过你
If it's big-boobed, they did zero research.

72
00:03:39,740 --> 00:03:42,860
她来自澳大利亚 是个冉冉上升的新星
Tess is from Australia. She's a rising star

73
00:03:42,860 --> 00:03:44,580
出道作品为浪漫喜剧"泥嚎凯特"
and got her start in the romantic comedy G'day Kate.

74
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:49,480
麦克斯 你的角色将由瓦妮莎·罗宾森
Max, you're being played by Vanessa Robinson.

75
00:03:50,020 --> 00:03:52,100
一个小咖 不是女主都这样
Not a name, but that's what they do.

76
00:03:53,820 --> 00:03:54,920
瓦妮莎·罗宾森吗
Vanessa Robinson?

77
00:03:55,300 --> 00:03:57,140
她主持我最爱的迪士尼节目
She's on my favorite Disney show,

78
00:03:57,440 --> 00:03:59,240
"真是太瓦妮莎·罗宾森啦"
That's So Vanessa Robinson.

79
00:04:00,700 --> 00:04:03,960
他们怎么会指望迪士尼傻白甜来演我啊
How do they expect a Disney goody-two-shoes to play me?

80
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:06,520
她演不出真的吸嗨 喝醉
She won't be realistic playing high or drunk

81
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:08,380
或是跟电影《荒野猎人》里熊搏斗的样子
or fighting the bear from The Revenant.

82
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:11,580
麦克斯 谁演我啊
Ooh, Max, who's playing me?

83
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:14,000
米雪儿·金
Michelle Kim?

84
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,380
是女人来演我吗
I'm being played by a woman?

85
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:20,780
冷静 不是女人 是个11岁女孩
Calm down, not a woman. It's an 11-year-old girl.

86
00:04:22,080 --> 00:04:24,300
而且人家估计比你还不爽好吗
And she's probably more upset about it than you are.

87
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,140
真是天方夜谭
That's preposterous.

88
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:28,380
11岁小女孩怎么可能是餐厅老板
An 11-year-old girl couldn't own a diner.

89
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:29,460
你就是啊
You do.

90
00:04:32,640 --> 00:04:34,420
两位 我把你们的午餐拿来啦
Hey, guys. I picked up your lunch.

91
00:04:34,820 --> 00:04:36,720
还有另外两份从这里点的外卖
There were two other orders from customers in here.

92
00:04:39,540 --> 00:04:43,960
鲍比 苔丝·沃克要在电影里扮演我
Bobby, Tess Walker is playing me in the movie about me.

93
00:04:44,905 --> 00:04:47,660
"泥嚎凯特"的那个啊
From G'day Kate!

94
00:04:47,660 --> 00:04:50,460
她是凯特对吧
Oh, yeah. She's Kate, right?

95
00:04:50,460 --> 00:04:51,980
还是里面对凯特说"泥嚎"的那个人
Or or the one that says "G'day" to her?

96
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:54,400
无论是哪个 都没你漂亮
Either way, she's not as pretty as you.

97
00:04:56,220 --> 00:04:58,780
你总是知道该说哪句我教你的话
Ohh, you know exactly what I tell you to say.

98
00:05:00,500 --> 00:05:02,536
不是我们店里做的薯条好好吃啊
Ooh, the fries are good from not here.

99
00:05:02,536 --> 00:05:04,884
奥列格 过来尝尝
Oleg, try these.

100
00:05:08,149 --> 00:05:10,080
奥列格
Hey, Oleg.

101
00:05:10,080 --> 00:05:13,560
上面写皮特·奇尔顿来扮演你
It says here you're being played by Pete Chilton.

102
00:05:14,440 --> 00:05:17,020
天啊 他就是我们一起看过的搞笑电影里
My gosh, he's the one who played the serial killer

103
00:05:17,020 --> 00:05:19,420
扮演连环杀手的那个人
in that funny movie we saw.

104
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:22,260
希望他下面大小与我一致
I hope the penis is accurate.

105
00:05:23,080 --> 00:05:24,820
他会正面全裸对吧
This is a full frontal role, right?

106
00:05:25,100 --> 00:05:26,020
反正咱们店里是这样
It is here.

107
00:05:27,420 --> 00:05:30,080
上面貌似没有苏菲这个角色
Oh, it doesn't look like there's a Sophie character.

108
00:05:30,420 --> 00:05:32,220
但有个角色叫珍珠
Oh, but there is one named Pearl,

109
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:35,140
是餐厅收银员 她是一名黑人波兰妞
a Black Polish woman who works as the diner's cashier.

110
00:05:36,220 --> 00:05:36,780
什么
What?

111
00:05:38,280 --> 00:05:40,360
他们居然把我跟厄尔合一了
They combined me with Earl?

112
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:46,120
如果我想要跟任何人合一
I mean, if I wanted to be combined with someone,

113
00:05:46,260 --> 00:05:48,180
我就不会宁愿放弃一个肾
I wouldn't have given up a liver

114
00:05:48,180 --> 00:05:50,200
也要跟我的连体姐妹分开了
to be separated from my twin.

115
00:05:51,520 --> 00:05:53,260
他们把我变成了女人吗
Hey, they made me a woman?

116
00:05:53,700 --> 00:05:56,280
我上一次假扮女人 还是想跟玛丽莲·梦露
I haven't been a woman since I was trying to outrun

117
00:05:56,280 --> 00:05:57,740
逃出黑帮魔爪的时候
the mob with Marilyn Monroe.

118
00:05:59,460 --> 00:06:00,900
天啊 卡洛琳
Oh, holy crap, Caroline.

119
00:06:00,940 --> 00:06:03,140
这部电影里有你前男友糖果安迪这角色
Your ex Candy Andy's a character in the movie

120
00:06:03,140 --> 00:06:04,820
他本人也会出现在媒体毒会
and he's gonna be at the press junkie.

121
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:08,140
是餐会 你才是毒会[虫] 别搞混了
Junket. You're a junkie, get it right.

122
00:06:08,740 --> 00:06:10,940
还有糖果安迪 他为什么会出现在电影里
And Candy Andy? Why is he in the movie?

123
00:06:11,180 --> 00:06:14,060
这个年纪应该可以叫唐国·安德鲁了吧
Shouldn't he be old enough to go by Candrew Andrew at this point?

124
00:06:15,260 --> 00:06:17,600
鲍比 在你疯狂吃干醋之前
Bobby, before you get crazy jealous,

125
00:06:17,660 --> 00:06:19,600
我想说他帅到翻
he is very handsome

126
00:06:20,140 --> 00:06:22,300
而且我跟他在床事上
and I went places with him sexually

127
00:06:22,300 --> 00:06:24,780
到达过我个人从未到过之境
that I had never been before.

128
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:32,220
但无论如何 我现在跟你在一起 他也结婚了
But--ah, anyway, I'm with you, now, and he's married.

129
00:06:32,220 --> 00:06:35,400
很棒啊 我... 真的不是会吃醋的那种男人
That's cool, I'm just-- I'm just not a jealous guy.

130
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:38,080
我对我们岩石般稳固的爱情有信心
I am confident in our rock solid relationship.

131
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:40,300
这样就很讨人厌了
Well, that's very annoying.

132
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:47,500
这么多的记者跟摄影师让我想起
All these reporters and photographers remind me

133
00:06:47,500 --> 00:06:48,960
当年我掉乳牙时的场景
of when I lost my baby teeth.

134
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:52,240
我爸在我枕头底下留了一间避暑别墅
Oh, my father left a summer home under my pillow.

135
00:06:52,580 --> 00:06:55,820
我乳牙是终极格斗赛上被明星女格斗家打掉的
I left my baby teeth in the octagon with Ronda Rousey.

136
00:06:56,380 --> 00:06:59,120
这是个给我们甜品酒吧做广告的好机会
This would be a great opportunity to plug our dessert bar.

137
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:01,420
咱们先绕一圈然后小声谈论我们的店
Let's do a lap and start whispering about ourselves

138
00:07:01,420 --> 00:07:02,260
来引起大家兴趣
to get a buzz going.

139
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:05,520
如果你觉得都早上11点了我还没嗨[兴趣]上
If you think I don't already have a buzz going at 11:00 A.M.,

140
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:06,400
那你真是太不了解我了
then you don't know me.

141
00:07:07,100 --> 00:07:09,440
天啊 那是苏菲跟厄尔的合体
Oh, my God, that's the Sophie and Earl mash-up.

142
00:07:12,420 --> 00:07:14,840
她是迪士尼《女孩看世界》的美式足球教练
She was the football coach on Girl Meets World!

143
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:15,990
越来越像回事啦
This is getting real!

144
00:07:15,990 --> 00:07:17,630
卡洛琳·钱宁吗
Caroline Channing?

145
00:07:18,020 --> 00:07:19,860
我叫黛西 我是公关团队的人
I'm Daisy. I'm with the PR team.

146
00:07:20,260 --> 00:07:22,220
你有可能听说过我 卡戴珊同父异母的妹妹
Maybe you've heard of me. Kylie Jenner threw

147
00:07:22,220 --> 00:07:23,900
去年往我头上扔了整瓶雪碧
a full can of Sprite at my head last year.

148
00:07:24,200 --> 00:07:25,560
这就是为什么我的瞳孔这么大
That's why my pupils are so big!

149
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:28,600
黛西 别担心 我这人不难搞
Daisy, don't worry. I am not high maintenance.

150
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:30,700
我怎么样才能确保我所有的照片
How can I be sure that all photos of me

151
00:07:30,700 --> 00:07:32,780
全都拍我的右侧脸呢
are taken on the north side of my face?

152
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:34,440
我叫麦克斯
I'm Max.

153
00:07:34,860 --> 00:07:37,180
当你的瞳孔消失时 是代表什么意思
Uh, what does it mean when you don't have pupils?

154
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:39,360
你们真是太萌了
You guys are so cute.

155
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:40,840
我知道你们还没看过这部电影
Oh, I know you haven't seen the movie,

156
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:43,040
所以我简单告诉你们一下剧情
so I'll give you a quick rundown of what happens

157
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:43,940
好应付媒体提问
for press questions.

158
00:07:44,620 --> 00:07:46,460
我看看 你损失所有财产
Uh, let's see. You lose your money.

159
00:07:46,640 --> 00:07:48,720
惨惨惨 然后你遇到她
Sad, sad, sad. And then you meet this one.

160
00:07:48,900 --> 00:07:49,820
惨惨惨
Sad, sad, sad.

161
00:07:50,220 --> 00:07:51,500
你真是太萌了
You are so cute.

162
00:07:51,660 --> 00:07:53,880
电影已经不单纯只是说你们两个了
It's not as much about the two of you anymore.

163
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:54,960
故事情节有点拉拉味儿
The storyline came off a little lesbionic,

164
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:57,000
坦白说 挺去年的炒作法
which is kinda last year.

165
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,760
我也有点拉拉味儿
I just came off a little lesbionic.

166
00:07:59,980 --> 00:08:01,760
有小妞一直不停打电话找我
Maggie won't stop calling me.

167
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:03,680
天啊
Oh, my God.

168
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:06,620
苔丝来了 她真是完美无瑕
There's Tess. Oh, she's flawless.

169
00:08:06,860 --> 00:08:08,260
饰演我的完美人选
She's the perfect me.

170
00:08:08,540 --> 00:08:11,000
苔丝 是我 你 卡洛琳
Tess, It's me! You, Caroline!

171
00:08:11,880 --> 00:08:14,080
扮演你的姑娘还没到场
Oh, and the young lady playing you hasn't shown up yet.

172
00:08:14,300 --> 00:08:16,320
真的麦克斯本人也应该缺席
Oh, that's what the real Max should've done.

173
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:19,680
你真是太萌了 她下了狠心研究
You're so cute. No, she went real method

174
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:20,900
就为了进入你这角色的状态
in researching the role of you.

175
00:08:20,900 --> 00:08:22,460
她现在对毒品严重上瘾了
And now she's real into drugs.

176
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:25,120
我超难过 但是你们看不出
I'm so upset. You just can't tell

177
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:26,440
因为我吃很强的抗忧郁药
because I'm heavily medicated.

178
00:08:28,340 --> 00:08:29,780
你好啊 没人看管的酒吧
Hello, unattended bar.

179
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:33,540
卡洛琳·钱宁本人
Caroline Channing in person.

180
00:08:34,060 --> 00:08:35,460
这感觉想必与当年
Oh, this must be what it was like

181
00:08:35,460 --> 00:08:37,060
茱莉娅·罗伯茨与艾琳·布劳克维奇相遇一样
when Julia Roberts met Erin Brockovich.

182
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:39,552
或者反过来 我是罗伯茨
Or the other way around.

183
00:08:39,552 --> 00:08:43,320
他是布伦特 饰演糖果安迪
Oh, and this is Brent, the actor playing Candy Andy.

184
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:44,900
我们两个之间应该尴尬一下
Should it be awkward between us

185
00:08:44,900 --> 00:08:46,779
因为你饰演我多年来唯二的
since you're playing one in a long string

186
00:08:46,779 --> 00:08:49,640
前男友之一吗
of two ex-boyfriends?

187
00:08:49,640 --> 00:08:50,160
谢谢
Thanks.

188
00:08:53,060 --> 00:08:54,360
谢谢您如此悲催的人生
Thanks for having a tragic life

189
00:08:54,580 --> 00:08:56,119
我才有机会在戏里坠入爱河
so I could fall in love on screen.

190
00:08:56,119 --> 00:08:59,044
戏外亦然
And off.

191
00:08:59,740 --> 00:09:03,080
我觉得观众们会比较想看到我
Uh, see, I think audiences would much rather see me

192
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:05,120
跟一个... 比如说劳动阶级的
wind up with, let's say, a working class,

193
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:06,960
可能名字叫鲍比的蓝领包工头在一起
blue collar contractor, maybe named Bobby.

194
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:10,280
你真萌 但是不行 因为很明显
You're so cute. No, it was pretty obvious

195
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:12,020
大家都觉得你应该跟糖果安迪在一起
to everyone you should wind up with Candy Andy.

196
00:09:12,500 --> 00:09:14,240
我也这么觉得
Yeah, I thought so, too.

197
00:09:15,100 --> 00:09:15,820
糖果安迪
Candy Andy!

198
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:18,620
我现在不用这个傻名字了 麦克斯
I do not go by that silly name, Max.

199
00:09:18,700 --> 00:09:20,080
我现在叫唐国·安德鲁
It's Candrew Andrew.

200
00:09:21,820 --> 00:09:22,460
安德鲁
Andrew.

201
00:09:23,660 --> 00:09:24,740
你看起来很不错
You look great.

202
00:09:25,025 --> 00:09:26,415
对不起
Oh, sorry, ooh.

203
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:32,460
你们两个看起来就像我跟我八年级的科学老师
You two are like me and my eighth grade science teacher.

204
00:09:32,580 --> 00:09:34,660
总是忍不住对对方上下其手
Just can't keep your hands off each other.

205
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:38,100
麦克斯 你毁了你老师的一生
Max, you ruined Mr. Brillstein's life,

206
00:09:38,140 --> 00:09:40,740
而安迪也像你老师一样 是有妇之夫
and, like Mr. Brillstein, Andy is married.

207
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:42,900
其实我离婚了
Oh, uh, well, actually I'm divorced.

208
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:48,100
这就是你奈特·沙马兰级的剧情翻转
There's your M. Night Shyamalan twist!

209
00:09:48,680 --> 00:09:50,720
但电影其他部分还是别让他导了
But don't let him direct the rest of the movie.

210
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:53,660
让摄影师给两位拍个照可以吗
Oh, how about a picture of you two for the photographers?

211
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:54,960
你们看起来很般配
You look great together.

212
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:58,380
你的婚姻走到尽头我深感遗憾
I'm sorry your marriage didn't work out.

213
00:09:58,480 --> 00:09:59,280
我也是
Yeah, me too.

214
00:09:59,460 --> 00:10:01,400
我岳父有纽约流浪者队的贵宾席票呢
My father-in-law had box seats to the Rangers.

215
00:10:02,620 --> 00:10:03,600
你看起来真美
You look beautiful.

216
00:10:04,760 --> 00:10:06,424
你嘴唇上有我的口红
You have my lipstick on your mouth.

217
00:10:06,424 --> 00:10:08,531
有可能只是我们刚好擦了同款
Oh, well, maybe we wear the same shade.

218
00:10:09,580 --> 00:10:12,080
这杯6... 27块
That'll be six--ehh, $27.

219
00:10:18,860 --> 00:10:20,740
厄尔 不用起了
Hey, Earl. Don't get up.

220
00:10:21,020 --> 00:10:22,660
想起也起不来 除非有公司
No chance of that, unless they start

221
00:10:22,660 --> 00:10:24,980
开始制造给整个身体用的伟哥
making Viagra for the entire body.

222
00:10:27,700 --> 00:10:29,280
卡洛琳不在 你来干嘛
Uh, Caroline's not here. What do you need?

223
00:10:29,500 --> 00:10:31,220
其实我来是想找你们聊聊
Actually, I wanted to talk to you guys.

224
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:33,080
虽然她曾告诫我千万不要这么做
Even though she told me never to do that.

225
00:10:34,620 --> 00:10:37,220
你们想看长得像原始摩登人的咪咪头吗
You guys wanna see a nipple that looks like Fred Flintstone?

226
00:10:39,340 --> 00:10:40,360
现在我知道原因了
Now I see why.

227
00:10:41,160 --> 00:10:43,780
如果是想推销安利 我已经受骗上当过两次了
If this is an Amway pitch, I've fallen for that twice.

228
00:10:44,020 --> 00:10:46,860
这么说吧 推销推我上债台下地狱
Let's just say I am way in debt.

229
00:10:47,700 --> 00:10:49,700
不是啦 是关于那个叫安迪的家伙
No, it's this--this Andy guy.

230
00:10:49,860 --> 00:10:50,980
你们能跟我说说他的情况吗
What can you tell me about him?

231
00:10:51,140 --> 00:10:52,500
他帅吗 有钱吗
Is he good looking? Rich?

232
00:10:52,740 --> 00:10:54,640
他是亚马逊的金牌会员吗 我要愁死了
Does he have Amazon Prime? I'm dying, here.

233
00:10:56,100 --> 00:10:58,600
我还以为你不是爱吃醋的那种人
Oh, I thought you weren't the jealous type.

234
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:01,900
可你就像瘦版的乔纳·希尔试图搞笑
But you're sweating like skinny Jonah Hill trying to be funny

235
00:11:01,900 --> 00:11:03,840
或肥版的乔纳·希尔试图正经时那样喷汗
or fat Jonah Hill trying to be serious.

236
00:11:05,500 --> 00:11:06,940
我就是爱吃醋的那种人
Well, I am the jealous type.

237
00:11:06,940 --> 00:11:08,900
我只是想在卡洛琳面前扮酷而已
I just wanted to look cool in front of Caroline.

238
00:11:08,940 --> 00:11:10,500
我才不在乎在你们面前形象如何
I don't care what I look like in front of you guys.

239
00:11:11,140 --> 00:11:11,560
明显看得出
Obviously.

240
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:15,720
你没什么可担心的 安迪
You have nothing to worry about, Andy.

241
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:17,100
我是说 鲍比
I mean, Bobby.

242
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:20,020
这情况非常像
Much like the copy of TV Guide

243
00:11:20,020 --> 00:11:21,400
厄尔正在读的《电视指南》旧刊
Earl is currently reading,

244
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:23,120
糖果安迪早是旧闻了
Candy Andy is old news.

245
00:11:23,548 --> 00:11:27,546
你们知道今晚要播最新一集的《生命的事实》吗
Ooh, there's another episode of Facts of Life tonight, you know?

246
00:11:28,709 --> 00:11:31,129
大家安...
Hey, everybo--

247
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:34,880
难道你不想帮我把句子说完吗 厄尔
Wouldn't you like to finish that sentence for me, Earl?

248
00:11:35,920 --> 00:11:39,420
反正你在卡洛琳的电影里也没有属于自己的角色
Since you don't have your own character in Caroline's movie.

249
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:42,940
没错 你们说得对
Yeah, you're right.

250
00:11:43,060 --> 00:11:44,300
我没什么好担心的
I got nothing to worry about.

251
00:11:44,420 --> 00:11:45,120
我该走了
I should get going.

252
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,340
安迪
Hey, Andy.

253
00:11:47,220 --> 00:11:48,300
我是叫 鲍比
I mean, Bobby.

254
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:52,300
快看 你有看见这张
Look, did you see this picture

255
00:11:52,300 --> 00:11:54,260
卡洛琳和糖果安迪的合影吗
of Caroline with Candy Andy?

256
00:11:54,760 --> 00:11:57,300
瞧瞧 他在餐会上用胳膊搂着她
Look, he's got his arm around her at a junket.

257
00:11:58,240 --> 00:12:01,060
他的手是放在她的背部下方还是屁股上方
Is that hand on her lower back or upper butt?

258
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:04,280
兄弟 还好你不是爱吃醋的那种人
Hey, man, it's a good thing you're not the jealous type.

259
00:12:05,540 --> 00:12:07,620
尤其是因为他把手放在她屁股那儿
Especially since he has his hand right on her ass.

260
00:12:09,640 --> 00:12:12,320
喂 我才刚想说这句话
Hey...I was gonna say that!

261
00:12:14,160 --> 00:12:18,200
你就不能别什么东西都跟我抢吗 厄尔
Can you at least give me one thing of my own, Earl?

262
00:12:24,520 --> 00:12:26,300
我去我们的卡座了
I'll be in our booth.

263
00:12:31,740 --> 00:12:33,280
我代表《纽约时报》
I'm from the New York Times.

264
00:12:33,540 --> 00:12:35,260
你怎么会沦落到这种地方
Ha, what the hell are you doing here?

265
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,740
我有个问题问苔丝
I have a question for Tess.

266
00:12:38,260 --> 00:12:41,480
在"泥嚎凯特"里 你为了绿卡跟一只袋鼠结婚是吗
In G'day Kate, you married a kangaroo for a green card?

267
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:43,880
感觉真是超级怪 对吧
So this is super weird, right?

268
00:12:43,880 --> 00:12:45,140
看着他们 扮演我们
Looking at them, being us.

269
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:48,640
安迪 我现在不能说话 我得推广我们酒吧
Andy, I can't talk now. I have to promote my dessert bar

270
00:12:48,640 --> 00:12:50,000
还得回答所有媒体的问题
and answer all these questions.

271
00:12:50,300 --> 00:12:51,460
你也知道当记者碰到
You know how reporters get

272
00:12:51,460 --> 00:12:53,120
一个吸引人的话题时他们会怎么样
when they have a fascinating subject.

273
00:12:54,160 --> 00:12:55,620
卡洛琳 没人问你问题
Caroline, no one's asked you anything

274
00:12:55,620 --> 00:12:57,460
而且人家早就告诉你 不要再举手示意了
and they already told you to stop raising your hand.

275
00:12:59,540 --> 00:13:01,880
麦克斯 饰演你的演员没来
Max, the actress playing you isn't here.

276
00:13:02,140 --> 00:13:04,520
据报道自从她进入你这个角色后
It's been reported she's been on a downward spiral

277
00:13:04,520 --> 00:13:05,680
生活堕落事业下滑
ever since she got into the role.

278
00:13:06,420 --> 00:13:08,480
她的行为令人厌恶
Her behavior is disgusting,

279
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:10,280
而我表示非常赞同
and I very much approve.

280
00:13:11,540 --> 00:13:14,700
有个问题想问米雪儿 饰演阿憨一角的小妹妹
This is for Michelle, the young lady playing the Han character.

281
00:13:16,260 --> 00:13:17,920
你为什么想饰演这个角色
What drove you to the role?

282
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:20,580
我妈说如果我想无限流量上网
My mom said I had to start helping out in this family

283
00:13:20,580 --> 00:13:22,020
那就得开始出来赚钱养家
if I wanted unlimited data.

284
00:13:23,700 --> 00:13:25,880
饰演珍珠一角的珍妮儿
And for Janelle, portraying Pearl,

285
00:13:26,420 --> 00:13:28,500
你是如何准备演绎一个集黑人
how did you prepare to play a Black man

286
00:13:28,500 --> 00:13:29,980
和比常人大一号的波兰女人于一体的角色
and a larger-than-life Polish woman?

287
00:13:30,400 --> 00:13:33,060
两个口音教练 外加大量假发
Two dialogue coaches and a lot of wigs.

288
00:13:34,660 --> 00:13:38,400
我一接到奥列格这个角色后 就再也没有洗过澡了
And I stopped showering the minute I got the role of Oleg.

289
00:13:42,260 --> 00:13:44,420
卡洛琳 我有个关于咱俩的问题想问你
Caroline, I have a question for you about us.

290
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:47,160
问答会不是让你提问的地方
A Q & A is not the place for questions.

291
00:13:48,020 --> 00:13:49,160
好吧 那我不问了
Well, fine, I won't ask you, then.

292
00:13:49,160 --> 00:13:49,900
我就直接说吧
I'll just tell you.

293
00:13:50,360 --> 00:13:53,100
我想你 想你那可爱的歪嘴一笑
I miss you and your adorable crooked smile.

294
00:13:53,540 --> 00:13:55,000
瞧瞧好莱坞版的我们
I mean, look at the Hollywood us.

295
00:13:55,340 --> 00:13:57,160
我们可以成为现实生活中的他们
We could be the real version of them.

296
00:13:57,540 --> 00:13:58,480
不过我可不会画眼线
Just, you know, I wouldn't wear guyliner.

297
00:14:00,860 --> 00:14:02,940
卡洛琳 命运让我们相遇肯定是有原因的
Caroline, fate brought us together for a reason.

298
00:14:03,660 --> 00:14:05,060
我们曾拥有美好的爱情
I mean, we had a really good thing.

299
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:06,660
我觉得我们应该再给彼此一个机会
I think we should give it another shot.

300
00:14:08,100 --> 00:14:11,300
卡洛琳·钱宁 你刚说你现在经营一家甜品酒吧是吗
Caroline Channing, you said you own a dessert bar now?

301
00:14:16,460 --> 00:14:17,460
卡洛琳居然说不出话来了
Caroline's speechless.

302
00:14:18,260 --> 00:14:20,620
看来向神灯许的愿望只剩两个没实现
Guess I'm down to two wishes on that magic lamp.

303
00:14:24,620 --> 00:14:25,780
你觉得怎么样
So what do you think?

304
00:14:26,220 --> 00:14:27,780
我觉得那个妞可能挂了
I think that girl might be dead.

305
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:30,960
可我跟安迪怎么办
But what about me and Andy?

306
00:14:31,140 --> 00:14:34,000
我们俩试过在一起很合拍 这不代表什么吗
I mean, you don't think it means something that we tested well.

307
00:14:34,280 --> 00:14:37,620
我也经常试东试西 检测都呈阳性
Hey, I test positive for stuff all the time.

308
00:14:38,980 --> 00:14:41,560
所以我不能捐血或输血
I'm not allowed to donate or get blood,

309
00:14:41,660 --> 00:14:43,400
但除此之外 没啥问题啊
but other than that, it's cool.

310
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:48,580
我和安迪的确看起来很般配
Ugh, Andy and I do look great together.

311
00:14:49,160 --> 00:14:51,780
万一美国比我还了解我自己呢
What if America knows more about me than I do?

312
00:14:51,980 --> 00:14:54,660
那么我会觉得美国比我感觉中的更糟
Then I feel worse for America than I already do.

313
00:14:56,300 --> 00:14:57,420
我不懂这有什么好值得商讨的
I-I don't know why any of this matters.

314
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:58,680
安迪知道你有男朋友了
Andy knows you have a boyfriend.

315
00:15:00,340 --> 00:15:02,000
我没告诉他
I didn't tell him.

316
00:15:02,340 --> 00:15:03,820
为什么我没告诉他
Why didn't I tell him?

317
00:15:04,260 --> 00:15:05,800
沙马兰级的反转又来了
And boom goes the Shyamalan.

318
00:15:08,400 --> 00:15:10,580
麦克斯 我问了他们没有巧克力牛奶
Hey, Max, they don't have chocolate milk, I asked.

319
00:15:10,689 --> 00:15:15,660
那他们要我喝什么配虾啊
Ugh! How do they expect me to wash down my scrimps?

320
00:15:15,660 --> 00:15:17,140
卡洛琳 我们能谈谈吗
Caroline, can we just talk

321
00:15:17,140 --> 00:15:18,740
或许谈完后顺便共度下余生
and maybe spend the rest of our lives together?

322
00:15:18,840 --> 00:15:19,860
放轻松就行
You know, keep it casual.

323
00:15:21,940 --> 00:15:23,900
糖果先生
Hey! Mr. Candy guy!

324
00:15:24,280 --> 00:15:26,000
把你的手从我女人身上拿开
Get your hands off my girl!

325
00:15:27,400 --> 00:15:28,880
伙计 你把我喝的弄洒了
Dude, you spilled my drink!

326
00:15:29,760 --> 00:15:31,000
她是我的女朋友
She's my girlfriend.

327
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:33,640
错了 她不是 你是谁来着
No, she is not. Who are you?

328
00:15:36,380 --> 00:15:39,680
鲍比 你打翻醋缸打错人了
Bobby, you attacked the wrong Andy in a jealous rage.

329
00:15:39,780 --> 00:15:40,420
真正的安迪在这里
He's over here.

330
00:15:41,700 --> 00:15:44,080
你好呀 我该把我这杯喝的放下吗
Hey, how's it going? Should I put my drink down?

331
00:15:44,980 --> 00:15:47,400
不用了 我已经够丢脸了
Ah, no...I've embarrassed myself enough.

332
00:15:47,640 --> 00:15:49,980
对不起 卡洛琳 我只是无法忍受
I'm sorry, Caroline. I just couldn't stand

333
00:15:49,980 --> 00:15:51,800
偷情早期你一周
the thought of you doing it with another guy

334
00:15:51,800 --> 00:15:53,340
跟别的男人睡一次的想法
once a week in the beginning.

335
00:15:54,120 --> 00:15:55,720
鲍比 我喜欢你吃醋
Bobby, I love that you're jealous--

336
00:15:56,920 --> 00:15:57,880
吃醋到会使用暴力
violently jealous.

337
00:15:57,880 --> 00:15:59,360
但你不需要这样
But you don't need to be.

338
00:15:59,980 --> 00:16:01,360
安迪 我有男朋友了
Andy, I have a boyfriend.

339
00:16:01,360 --> 00:16:03,760
一个吃醋到会使用暴力的男朋友
A violently jealous boyfriend.

340
00:16:04,700 --> 00:16:06,300
我不觉得那算暴力
I wouldn't say violently.

341
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:08,800
我早上为了一块馅饼差点把你掐死
I choked you out for a Pop-Tart this morning.

342
00:16:11,620 --> 00:16:13,520
好吧 现在真是超级尴尬
All right. Super awkward right now.

343
00:16:14,320 --> 00:16:15,800
我猜我得去取消刚请来
Um, well, I guess I'm gonna have to go

344
00:16:15,800 --> 00:16:18,040
为我们唱小夜曲的墨西哥街头乐队
cancel the Mariachi band I hired to serenade us.

345
00:16:18,500 --> 00:16:19,600
再见 10块钱订金
Adios, $10 deposit.

346
00:16:20,520 --> 00:16:22,500
你可以带他们来我们的甜品酒吧
Ooh, you should bring them by the dessert bar.

347
00:16:22,540 --> 00:16:24,220
我邀请演员们来参加餐后聚会
I'm having an after party there with the cast.

348
00:16:24,400 --> 00:16:25,180
是吗
We are?

349
00:16:26,880 --> 00:16:29,080
这个嘛...现在你也受邀参加了
Mm, well...I guess now you're invited, too.

350
00:16:31,700 --> 00:16:33,920
还有其他信息你可以用在戏里
And here's something else you can use.

351
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:37,300
通常我租车都租克莱斯勒
When I rent a car, I usually go with the Sebring.

352
00:16:38,040 --> 00:16:40,140
我开始明白为什么我的戏份大部分被删掉了
I'm starting to see why they cut most of my scenes.

353
00:16:41,280 --> 00:16:43,840
有一次我租了一辆丰田 就一次
Once I rented a Tercel. Once.

354
00:16:44,980 --> 00:16:46,080
我得接个电话
I gotta take this.

355
00:16:46,200 --> 00:16:48,460
我知道电话没响 但你懂的
I know it's not ringing, but you get it.

356
00:16:49,700 --> 00:16:51,800
麻烦正牌阿憨站起来
Will the real Han please stand up?

357
00:16:51,800 --> 00:16:52,540
然后离开
And then leave.

358
00:16:57,280 --> 00:16:59,440
我去我的卡座了
I'll be in my booth.

359
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:03,640
我去我的卡错了
I'll be in my booth.

360
00:17:06,580 --> 00:17:09,720
我去我的卡座了
I'll be in my booth.

361
00:17:11,320 --> 00:17:13,800
我去我的卡错了
I'll be in my booth.

362
00:17:16,260 --> 00:17:17,420
你就是领悟不到精髓
You just don't get it.

363
00:17:20,340 --> 00:17:23,480
我能把酒跟五片红药片混在一起喝吗
Can I mix alcohol and, like, five red pills?

364
00:17:24,100 --> 00:17:25,680
看我还站在这 你就知道可以啦
Ha, would I be standing here if you couldn't?

365
00:17:30,020 --> 00:17:34,040
这可能看起来很怪 也或许是够重口
Uh, this might seem weird or maybe just freaky enough,

366
00:17:34,180 --> 00:17:38,280
但我对那个妞饰演我的那部分很有性趣
but I am very attracted to that part of her that is me.

367
00:17:39,980 --> 00:17:42,600
你知道吗 厄尔 如果你表现好
You know what, Earl? You play your cards right,

368
00:17:42,660 --> 00:17:44,660
今晚你有可能睡"自己" 而不是自己睡
you might be screwing yourself tonight.

369
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:47,880
你好呀 妹子
What's up, girl?

370
00:17:50,180 --> 00:17:51,840
我有告诉过你 我变得超级有钱吗
Did I tell you that I got super rich?

371
00:17:52,300 --> 00:17:53,800
在六旗主题乐园受伤了
Yeah, got injured at Six Flags.

372
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:55,020
受伤的方式还挺窝囊
Not even in a cool way.

373
00:17:55,420 --> 00:17:57,040
被一个胖娃绊倒 摔到一个瘦娃身上
Tripped on a fat kid, landed on a skinny kid.

374
00:17:58,940 --> 00:18:00,060
或许你该去追求苔丝
Maybe you should go for Tess.

375
00:18:00,480 --> 00:18:01,780
我敢说她很快就会变单身
I bet she'll be single soon

376
00:18:01,780 --> 00:18:03,340
因为鲍比刚妒火爆发
since Bobby's jealous rage

377
00:18:03,340 --> 00:18:04,560
把她男朋友烧得进医院了
sent her boyfriend to the hospital.

378
00:18:04,780 --> 00:18:06,820
我才没有 我还要了他的签名
I did not. I got his autograph.

379
00:18:07,040 --> 00:18:08,696
他在《疯狂动物城》里给一只小鹦鹉配音
He voiced a parakeet in Zootopia.

380
00:18:08,696 --> 00:18:12,944
咕咕 想起来了吗
Cacaw. Ring a bell?

381
00:18:14,740 --> 00:18:16,020
那我就在此别过了
Well, I guess this is good-bye.

382
00:18:16,780 --> 00:18:18,280
下周的首映会我就不去了
I won't see you at the premiere next week.

383
00:18:18,380 --> 00:18:20,200
我要去巴黎消愁解闷
I'm gonna go drown my sorrows in Paris.

384
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:20,920
还有巴厘岛
And Bali.

385
00:18:21,240 --> 00:18:23,120
哪里有最贵的珠宝 我就去哪里
Well, wherever they have the most expensive jewels.

386
00:18:23,760 --> 00:18:24,100
有话要对我说吗
Anything?

387
00:18:25,740 --> 00:18:26,700
我就在这里
I'm right here.

388
00:18:27,520 --> 00:18:29,460
你们千万不要因为我打架
Guys, don't fight over me

389
00:18:29,460 --> 00:18:31,140
等我手机开始摄影后再打
until I have the camera open on my phone.

390
00:18:32,360 --> 00:18:33,900
你真是一个幸运的家伙 鲍比
Well, you're a lucky guy, Bobby.

391
00:18:34,320 --> 00:18:36,660
对了 她是一个非常可怕...
Just--by the way, she is a really horrible...

392
00:18:38,680 --> 00:18:40,460
算了 我想不出来缺点
No, I can't think of anything.

393
00:18:40,580 --> 00:18:41,440
她非常完美
She's pretty perfect.

394
00:18:43,740 --> 00:18:45,480
我相信如果你用心去寻找
I'm sure if you tried really hard

395
00:18:45,560 --> 00:18:46,920
你会找到那个人 她会愿意跟
you'll find someone willing to date

396
00:18:46,920 --> 00:18:50,000
一个正值美好年华的魅力多金男人约会
a very attractive rich guy in the prime of his life.

397
00:18:51,380 --> 00:18:52,360
你说得我都想跟他约会了
Now you're making me want to date him.

398
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:53,917
好了 我该走了
Well, I better get going.

399
00:18:53,917 --> 00:18:56,500
一到晚八点 直升飞机就堵得飞不动了
Helicopter traffic gets crazy at 8:00.

400
00:18:56,500 --> 00:18:56,840
有话要对我说吗
Anything?

401
00:19:00,500 --> 00:19:00,940
直升飞机
Helicopter?

402
00:19:04,640 --> 00:19:06,340
我一直在试图找瓦妮莎
I've been trying to look for Vanessa,

403
00:19:06,460 --> 00:19:08,580
但她现在可能换成她的帮派名字了
but she probably goes by her gang name, now.

404
00:19:09,980 --> 00:19:11,140
我在我的警方通讯接收器找不到她
I couldn't find her on my police scanner,

405
00:19:11,140 --> 00:19:13,880
但这玩意帮我躲过把大麻买给卧底警察
but it did help me avoid selling weed to an undercover cop.

406
00:19:15,240 --> 00:19:16,440
收到 长官
Copy that, Sarge.

407
00:19:19,740 --> 00:19:21,900
好了 奥列格 走吧
All right, Oleg. Let's go.

408
00:19:22,340 --> 00:19:25,260
今天周三 我们得把垃圾拿出来
It's Wednesday, so we gotta take the garbage out

409
00:19:25,260 --> 00:19:26,756
好让我们能在水槽下啪啪啪
so we can do it under the sink.

410
00:19:26,756 --> 00:19:29,299
水管工式性交
Ooh, plumber style.

411
00:19:31,280 --> 00:19:31,900
苏菲
Sophie.

412
00:19:33,120 --> 00:19:34,460
那不是我
That's not me.

413
00:19:35,440 --> 00:19:39,200
可是老天 他太棒了
But my God, he is gorgeous.

414
00:19:42,020 --> 00:19:45,120
我曾有一次做过这种春梦
I had a dream like this once.

415
00:19:45,680 --> 00:19:47,960
只是当时我满身涂满牛轧糖
Only I was covered in nougat.

416
00:19:50,020 --> 00:19:52,157
走吧 两个随便一个
Let's go, one of the Olegs.

417
00:19:52,157 --> 00:19:54,167
走啦 麦克斯
All right, bye, Max.

418
00:19:55,120 --> 00:19:56,360
你好 麦克斯
Oh, hi, Max.

419
00:19:57,680 --> 00:19:59,180
麦克斯 瓦妮莎来了
Max? Vanessa's here!

420
00:20:00,900 --> 00:20:02,660
天啊 你会没事的
Oh, my God. You're gonna be okay.

421
00:20:03,240 --> 00:20:05,298
继续喝 你只是因为想太快成为我
Just keep drinking. You tried being me too fast.

422
00:20:05,298 --> 00:20:06,720
-我... -别说话 喝吧
- I just-- - Don't talk, drink.

423
00:20:06,720 --> 00:20:07,880
你怎么这样还能没死啊
How are you not dead?

424
00:20:12,460 --> 00:20:13,400
你看见了吗
Did you see that?

425
00:20:13,700 --> 00:20:15,740
她从来没这样轻拍过我的头
She's never patted my head like that.

426
00:20:15,820 --> 00:20:19,040
她有次还给我兑换一次拍头的生日礼券
And she even gave me a birthday coupon for one free head pat.

427
00:20:19,720 --> 00:20:21,280
我是闻到一股醋味了吗
Is that jealousy I see?

428
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:24,480
我和麦克斯情比金坚
Max and I are in a strong relationship.

429
00:20:24,580 --> 00:20:25,720
我才没有吃醋
I am not jealous.

430
00:20:26,820 --> 00:20:28,440
她们俩是紧紧地拥抱在一起了吗
Are they in a full-on hug now?

431
00:20:28,440 --> 00:20:29,560
我要去兑换我的礼券了
I'm redeeming my coupon.

432
00:20:39,280 --> 00:20:39,800
有话要对我说吗
Anything?

433
00:20:40,985 --> 00:20:42,315
没有吗 那停吧
No? Okay, cut it.

434
00:20:43,580 --> 00:20:45,300
好吧 走吧 谁想坐直升飞机
Uh, all right, come on. Who likes helicopter rides?

435
00:20:48,300 --> 00:20:48,820
直升飞机
Helicopter?
